        "-   Seabold, Skipper, and Josef Perktold. **“statsmodels: Econometric and statistical modeling with python.”** Proceedings of the 9th Python in Science Conference, 2010.\n",
        "-   Stéfan van der Walt, S. Chris Colbert and Gaël Varoquaux. **The NumPy Array: A Structure for Efficient Numerical Computation, Computing in Science & Engineering**, 2011.\n",
